{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "102", "sample_idx": 33, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "\"Oh, darling, you look… comfortable,\" Seraphina said, swirling dramatically in her emerald green ball gown. The fabric shimmered under the dim hallway light.\n\nLeo sighed, pulling his sweatshirt tighter. \"And you look like you're about to float away. Seriously, Seraphina, is this really necessary? It's just the Tuesday Night Trivia at O'Malley's.\"\n\n\"Necessary? Leo, it's *the* Tuesday Night Trivia! It's a tradition! And one must make an *entrance*.\" She adjusted a stray jewel on her bodice. \"Besides, it's fun! Don't be such a grump.\"\n\n\"I'm not a grump. I'm practical. I’m wearing sweatpants. It’s practical. And frankly, I'm hoping to blend into the background and avoid any… unwanted attention.\"\n\nSeraphina giggled. \"Unwanted attention? From whom? The regulars? They adore you! And you're a trivia whiz! Last week you aced the obscure 18th-century poets round.\"\n\nLeo shrugged. \"It was luck. Anyway, I’m just trying to keep things low-key. This whole… spectacle… is a bit much for me.\"\n\n\"Nonsense! It's about enjoying yourself! Think of the prizes! A free appetizer! Bragging rights! And maybe, just maybe, a glimpse of Bartholomew’s prize-winning cheese.\"\n\n\"Bartholomew's cheese is not worth the discomfort of this gown.\"\n\n* You know, you really don’t have to wear the full gown. Just… *something* less… regal.\n* I’m just saying, maybe a simple cocktail dress? It would be less likely to get caught on things.\n* And please, for the love of all that is holy, try not to trip.\n\n\n\nSeraphina took his arm, her gloved hand cool against his. \"Come on, slowpoke! Let’s go dazzle them. And don’t worry, I'll be your safety net.\" She winked. \"Besides, a little bit of sparkle never hurt anyone.\"\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -0.06885108351707458}, {"token": "Oh", "logprob": -0.20756588876247406}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.